          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ kui̱ jurayä wec tharbëtdä kɛnɛ muc bɛɛl kɛ muc in waŋkɛ ni ciaŋ kɛnɛ muc ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä kɛ tuk path kɛnɛ ni̱n ti̱mä tin ca mɛk, kɛ kui̱ mucni ti rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ̱, kɛnɛ kui̱ mucni dui̱rä tin luɛ̈lkɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ kui̱ lätni diaal rɛy luaak Kuɔthda.",
